## 挂载示例：装一个"哲学-协议"最小集

```bash
# 用户只想要哲学 + 协议（最轻量）
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.paradigm "reactive"
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.proactiveness "respond-only"
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.mentor.enabled false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.drift.documentDriftCheck false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.drift.personalityDriftCheck false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.governance.threeStageReview false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.ooda.enabled false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.slcp.antiFragileTriptych false
openclaw config set plugins.entries.silicon-life-training.config.slcp.responseYieldProtocol false

# 此时 plugin 只剩卷一（哲学）+ 卷二（协议）+ 卷三（骨架）= 4 + 7 + 8 = 19 个挂载点
```

